Data in this folder
===================

File: imereti_sample.gpkg
Layers: municipalities (12 polygons), places (518 points),
        roads (1956 lines), rivers (380 lines)

Source:  OpenStreetMap data, extract of the region "Imereti" (Georgia),
         taken from the Geofabrik GmbH shapefile extract
         georgia-261019-free.shp (data state 2026-10-19).
Creator: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors
License: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
         https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
         https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Changes made: selected features inside the Imereti region polygon;
removed unused attributes; roads limited to classes motorway, trunk,
primary and secondary; places limited to city, town and village;
waterways limited to rivers. Geometries are unchanged (EPSG:4326).

This folder is a database derived from OpenStreetMap data and is
therefore distributed under the ODbL, independent of the license of
the book text and code in the rest of this repository.
